# ============================================================
# Secrets, keys & credentials — NEVER COMMIT THESE
# Applies repo-wide (all projects + the future mobile app).
# Blank templates are allowed: *.example / *.sample / *.template
# ============================================================

# Env files (every variant, in any folder)
.env
.env.*
*.env
!.env.example
!.env.sample
!.env.template
!.env.*.example

# Private keys & certificates
*.pem
*.key
*.p8
*.p12
*.pfx
*.jks
*.keystore
id_rsa
id_dsa
*_rsa
*_dsa

# Generic secret / credential files
secrets.*
*.secret
*.secrets
*secret*.json
credentials.json
*credentials*.json
service-account*.json
serviceAccountKey.json
*firebase-adminsdk*.json

# Mobile (Expo / React Native) signing & service configs
google-services.json
GoogleService-Info.plist
*.mobileprovision
.expo/

# Local databases (may contain tokens / hashed credentials)
*.sqlite3
*.db

# ============================================================
# Working memory - private to the author, not part of the portfolio
# ============================================================
#
# 06-context.md is the handoff log between working sessions: what was tried,
# what it cost, what turned out to be wrong, and the arguments behind decisions
# that were still being argued. It is written to be read by two people and it is
# not a deliverable. The other five requirements documents are the public spec
# and stay tracked.
#
# The pattern is the convention rather than one project, so a new app that
# follows the six-document layout is covered on the day it is created rather
# than the day somebody remembers.
**/requirements/06-context.md

# Trail models: keep what was written here, not what was downloaded.
#
# The recipes, the names and the manifest are the project's own work and are a
# few kilobytes. The packs are 681 MB of somebody else's models, replaceable
# from the URLs recorded in models/index.json. `npm run scan` rebuilds the
# manifest after re-downloading them.
trail/models/*.vox
trail/models/*/
!trail/models/names/
